        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/elegant/scene_llama.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 31711b91-fdae-4804-abaf-d8213ca13a78).Image",
        "Description": "这四个交际花是竞争对手派来的特工，戴安娜要求我们消灭她们，因为是在ICA的地盘上，不能被发现是ICA的杰作，当然了也不能误伤其他宾客，三分钟的时间，你能做到吗？\r\rThese four socialites are agents sent by competitors. Diana asked us to eliminate them, because they are on the territory of ICA and cannot be found to be the masterpiece of ICA. Of course, they can&apos;t hurt other guests by mistake. Can you do it in three minutes?",
